{#
  name: _render (dispatcher, not a section)
  purpose: Map a section's `type` to its macro (R-SEC-12). An unknown type fails the build.
  usage: {% from "sections/_render.njk" import section with context %}{{ section(s, ctx) }}
  note: every import is "with context" so the t filter sees the page's language; an argument a caller omits falls through to a page variable of the same name, so page data never uses macro argument names (the entity list is "entityList", the entity "e")
#}
